fbsdkpi: add m1-lkpi-extras' pd_xarray.c to the LinuxKPI source list

The file (Linux-semantics xarray functions over LinuxKPI's struct xarray: 64-bit index,
Linux error codes, xa_find, reserved entries) and its header linux/pd_xarray.h are
m1-lkpi-extras' c/pd_xarray.c and c/include/linux/pd_xarray.h, copied into pd/lkpi/ and
pd/lkpi-override/linux/ by lkpi/default.nix as they are. Applies after 0005.
UPSTREAM: yes, with those two files.

